  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2022 Africa Hunger crisis - remote information management support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Objective: improve speed, quality and cost-effectiveness of humanitarian interventions across all sectors, by providing multilateral support the Movement on information management, through the IFRC Africa Regional Office. Outcomes: more efficient, better targeted and more effective disaster response.
Outputs: analyses of current humanitarian needs, analyses for future impact, maps, dashboards and infographics (according to information needs), implementation of data management solutions for CVA and other sectors.</narrative>
  </description>
